 "name_zh": "奇伦托和迪亚诺河谷国家公园，帕埃斯图姆和韦利亚考古遗址",
 "name_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "name_en": "Cilento and Vallo di Diano National Park with the Archeological Sites of Paestum and Velia, and the Certosa di Padula",
 "name_local": "Paestum",
 "local_lang": "it",
